## 🔹 PART 14 — TROUBLESHOOTING

| Problem | Most Likely Cause | Fix |
|---|---|---|
| `TemplateDoesNotExist` | HTML file not found | Check file is in the right folder and spelled correctly |
| CSS not loading | `npm run dev` not running | Start the Tailwind terminal and hard refresh (`Ctrl+F5`) |
| Admin panel not working | Database not set up | Run `python manage.py migrate` |
| Tailwind classes not applying | Watcher not running | Restart `npm run dev` |
| `NoReverseMatch` error | URL name wrong | Check `{% url 'name' %}` matches `name=` in urls.py |
| `No module named 'nameofapp.urls'` | File doesn't exist | Create `nameofapp/urls.py` |
| Form not submitting | Missing CSRF token | Add `{% csrf_token %}` inside your `<form>` tag |
| `FieldError` after model change | Migration not run | Run `makemigrations` then `migrate` |
| `(env)` not showing | Environment not activated | Run `env\Scripts\activate` again |

