## ✅ KEY RULES TO ALWAYS REMEMBER

```
✔ Always activate your virtual environment before working
✔ Always register new apps in INSTALLED_APPS (settings.py)
✔ Always run makemigrations + migrate after changing models
✔ Always run migrate before creating a superuser
✔ Always keep npm run dev running in a separate terminal
✔ Always add {% csrf_token %} inside every POST form
✔ Always use {% load static %} at the top of base.html
✔ Template file must be named base.html (not _base.html)
```

---

## ❌ THINGS TO AVOID

```
✗ Don't use django-compressor (not needed, causes confusion)
✗ Don't install tailwindcss@3 (use the standard tailwindcss + @tailwindcss/cli)
✗ Don't name your base template _base.html (use base.html)
✗ Don't forget the dot (.) when creating a project: django-admin startproject config .
✗ Don't create a superuser before running migrate
✗ Don't forget {% csrf_token %} in forms — your form will silently fail
```

